[{"id":"CN-CAP-FAQ-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["QUIC","TCP","回退"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":11,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>QUIC 的 UDP 失败后会自动变成 TCP 吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不会由 UDP 协议本身自动转换。是否回退到 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/1.1 由客户端、浏览器、服务器和部署提示共同决定。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>验证时记录协议提示、UDP 可达性、QUIC 错误和最终协商结果，不能把回退当作传输层自动行为。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>回退不是 UDP 自己完成的转换：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>组件\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>可能参与的动作\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>客户端/浏览器\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选择协议、读取 Alt-Svc\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>网络路径\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>放行或丢弃 UDP/QUIC\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>服务端/代理\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>提供 h3 并接受 h2/h1\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>要记录协商结果、QUIC 错误和最终 ALPN，才能解释为什么走了回退。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-009","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","FIN","RST"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":9,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>FIN 和 RST 的核心差异是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>FIN 有序地结束一个方向并允许剩余数据收尾；RST 立即拒绝或重置连接，未完成的应用数据通常以错误结束。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>未监听端口、访问已重置套接字或异常关闭可能产生 RST；正常 EOF 更接近 FIN。最终仍要结合系统调用和抓包。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>关闭问题先标注方向，再判断状态：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>语义\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>常见下一步\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>FIN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>仅一个方向结束\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>看对端是否继续发送\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CLOSE-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>本端收到 FIN 但应用未关闭\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查资源释放路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TIME-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>主动关闭方等待旧报文消失\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查短连接与复用\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>RST\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>立即重置\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查未监听、异常关闭或错误路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-di-vs-middleware","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["架构","依赖注入"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理","articlePath":"posts/6ddff2f0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(九)请求管线与错误处理","articlePath":"posts/52af630c/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理","articlePath":"posts/6ddff2f0/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>依赖注入和中间件分别适合承载什么逻辑？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>依赖注入面向路由所需的类型化资源和权限，中间件面向每个请求/响应都要经过的协议级横切逻辑。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>用户身份、数据库会话和参数策略通常需要被处理函数直接使用，放进依赖图更容易测试和表达 OpenAPI 关系；请求 ID、耗时、CORS 等必须观察整个请求生命周期，放进中间件更合适。把所有逻辑塞进中间件会失去参数级依赖关系，把每个请求都包成依赖又可能无法看到响应回程。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-fill-type","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["表单","输入"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(五)页面交互操作.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(五)页面交互操作","articlePath":"posts/fdf6b990/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fill()\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>press_sequentially()\u003c/code> 的主要区别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fill()\u003c/code> 设置完整值，\u003ccode>press_sequentially()\u003c/code> 逐键触发键盘事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>普通文本输入优先使用 \u003ccode>fill()\u003c/code>；只有搜索建议、输入掩码或逐键事件属于产品合同，才需要逐键输入。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>两种输入方式触发的事件不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">field.fill(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;hello&quot;\u003c/span>)                 \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 直接把最终值交给控件\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">field.press_sequentially(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;hello&quot;\u003c/span>)   \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 逐键触发键盘事件\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>普通表单只关心最终值时使用 fill；搜索建议、输入掩码或按键监听属于产品合同时，才需要逐键输入。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-001","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["分层","局域网"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一次同网段通信中，IP 地址和 MAC 地址分别解决什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>IP 决定逻辑目标和是否需要经过路由，MAC 负责当前链路上的一跳交付。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>主机先根据前缀判断目标是本地还是远端，再为当前下一跳获取 MAC。MAC 会在每一跳重写，不能当作跨互联网的最终地址。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可以用“最终目标”和“当前一跳”对照：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>字段\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>解决的问题\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>是否每跳变化\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目标 IP\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>数据最终要到哪个网络/主机\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常保持到达目标\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目的 MAC\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前链路交给哪个下一跳\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>经过路由器会重写\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>二层交换机只查 FDB；具备三层能力的设备才会进一步查路由表，不能把两种转发路径混为一谈。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]